[section=main][section_title1]Godot RmlUi[/section_title1]
Welcome to the documentation of [url=https://github.com/ghsoares/Godot-RmlUi]Godot RmlUi[/url], a GDExtension for rendering and manipulating documents using [url=https://github.com/mikke89/RmlUi]RmlUi[/url].

The table of contents in the sidebar should let you easily access the documentation for your topic of interest. You can also use the search function in the top-left corner.
[/section]
[section=contributing-to-documentation][section_title2]Contributing to Documentation[/section_title2]
If you want to contribute to Godot RmlUi's documentation, feel free to submit PRs and/or issues to it's [url=https://github.com/ghsoares/Godot-RmlUi-Docs]repository[/url].

This documentation was built using [url=https://github.com/ghsoares/gdex-doc-gen]GDExDocGen[/url], a simple static website generator which generates a documentation for your GDExtension with a style similar for Godot's documentation.
[/section]